comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T10:14:38.912Z","harness:codex","Duplicate-check evidence: all-status searches for GH-933, nested PM writes, PM_SOURCE_PM_PATH nested lifecycle, and the exact GitHub title found no canonical item. pm-954h0o/GH-682 is closed related lineage that intentionally preserved source VCS identity for validation; this issue owns the missing mutation boundary without reopening that completed behavior."
  "2026-08-08T10:32:50.788Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence 2026-08-08: linked-test children mark inherited source coordinates read_only; access and override keys cannot be changed by linked-test metadata; merge-install dry runs may inspect source state, while writes select the current package unless PM_ALLOW_SOURCE_CONTEXT_WRITES=1. The typed resolver reports selection. Focused 72/72 tests and full 6,997-test exact coverage pass. Packed-artifact acceptance used two temporary Git repos: the nested sibling npm lifecycle installed its own fence, the source fence SHA-256 stayed byte-identical, and the run passed."
